        309.0607604980469
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "latent state using parametric inference, thereby reducing sam-",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        319.650390625,
        563.0355224609375,
        328.55694580078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "pling variance. However, these methods still rely on manually",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
