        563.0355834960938,
        340.5119323730469
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "designed or limited-capacity proposals and are prone to sample",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        343.56036376953125,
        563.0355224609375,
        352.4669189453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "degeneracy, particularly in high-dimensional or perceptually",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        355.5153503417969,
        563.035400390625,
        364.4219055175781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "complex domains.",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        367.4703369140625,
        385.88055419921875,
        376.37689208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Recent developments in deep learning have introduced data-",
      "bbox": [
        321.94000244140625,
        379.9493408203125,
        563.0349731445312,
        388.85589599609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "driven alternatives to traditional state estimation methods.",
      "bbox": [
